<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><a href="/claim-gap-tools/">Claim tools</a><i aria-hidden="true">›</i><span aria-current="page">Claim Gap &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free estimator</p><h1>Claim Gap and Net Recovery Estimator</h1><p class="lede">Enter the carrier’s number and yours, guess where an award might land and add realistic fees. Three scenarios show whether appraisal is likely to leave you ahead.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap">
<div class="tool" data-tool="gap">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>Claim gap &amp; net recovery estimator</span><i>Runs in your browser · nothing stored</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ins">Insurer’s estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-ins" name="insurer" inputmode="decimal" value="16900"><span class="hint">Replacement cost total on the carrier’s estimate.</span></div>
        <div><label for="g-own">Your estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-own" name="yours" inputmode="decimal" value="29400"><span class="hint">Contractor or independent line-item estimate.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div><label for="g-land">Your best guess: where does the award land inside the gap?</label>
        <div class="range"><input id="g-land" type="range" name="land" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="55" data-unit="%"><output>55%</output></div>
        <span class="hint">0% means the carrier’s number holds; 100% means your full number is awarded.</span></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ft">Appraiser fee structure</label><select id="g-ft" name="feetype"><option value="flat">Flat fee ($)</option><option value="pct">Percent of the increase (%)</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="g-fee">Fee amount</label><input id="g-fee" name="fee" inputmode="decimal" value="2200"></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="useump" checked> Include my half of an umpire’s fee</label>
      <div><label for="g-ump">Umpire’s total fee</label><input id="g-ump" name="umpire" inputmode="decimal" value="2800"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>Estimated net increase at your guess</small><b data-o="net">$0</b></div>
      <div class="stack" aria-hidden="true"><span class="seg-a"></span><span class="seg-b"></span><span class="seg-c"></span></div>
      <div class="legend"><span><i class="seg-a"></i>Carrier’s number</span><span><i class="seg-b"></i>Your net gain</span><span><i class="seg-c"></i>Appraisal costs</span></div>
      <div class="out-rows">
        <div><span>Amount in dispute</span><b data-o="gap">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Gap as a share of the carrier estimate</span><b data-o="pct">—</b></div>
        <div><span>Projected award (RCV)</span><b data-o="award">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Your appraisal costs</span><b data-o="cost">$0</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="scen-h">Three scenarios side by side</p>
      <div class="scen"><div><small>Cautious (30%)</small><b data-o="s30">$0</b></div><div><small>Middle (55%)</small><b data-o="s55">$0</b></div><div><small>Strong (80%)</small><b data-o="s80">$0</b></div></div>
      <p class="out-msg" data-o="msg"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="hint">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>Using the estimator</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Enter the insurer’s RCV total</strong>, the replacement cost figure before depreciation and the deductible.</li>
<li><strong>Enter your own RCV estimate</strong> from a contractor or independent estimator.</li>
<li><strong>Set your best guess</strong> on the slider, then compare it with the cautious, middle and strong scenarios.</li>
<li><strong>Add fees</strong> using your appraiser’s quoted arrangement and a realistic umpire figure.</li></ol>
<h2>Read the cautious scenario first</h2>
<p>Panels rarely award either side’s opening number in full. Well-supported line items tend to survive and unsupported ones tend to fall away. If your net only looks good in the strong scenario, the file may need more documentation before you demand appraisal. If the cautious scenario still leaves you ahead, appraisal is more likely to be worthwhile.</p>
<h2>What this tool doesn’t include</h2>
<p>Depreciation timing, deductibles and policy limits change what you are paid, not the size of the dispute. For the payment split, use the <a href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV holdback calculator</a>. All figures are illustrative.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is the projected award a prediction?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. It is a planning scenario based on numbers you choose. Actual awards depend on documentation, the panel and your policy.</p></div></details><details><summary>What do umpires typically charge?</summary><div class="a"><p>Umpire fees vary with the size and complexity of the dispute. Ask for a quote when an umpire is proposed; most policies split the cost evenly.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</span></a><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</span></a><a href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Percentage Deductible Calculator</span></a></div></article><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sticky"><div class="side-box call-box"><p class="side-h">Talk it through</p><p>A free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="call-num" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-gold btn-block" href="/contact-us/">Send claim details</a></div><div class="side-box"><p class="side-h">All claim tools</p><ul class="side-list"><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/" aria-current="page">Claim Gap &amp; Net Recovery Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/rcv-acv-holdback-calculator/">RCV/ACV Holdback Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-pitch-squares-calculator/">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/percentage-deductible-calculator/">Percentage Deductible Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/claim-timeline-builder/">Claim Timeline Builder</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/appraisal-readiness-checkup/">Appraisal Readiness Checkup</a></li><li><a href="/claim-gap-tools/roof-snow-load-estimator/">Roof Snow Load Estimator</a></li></ul></div></div></aside></div><section class="cta-band"><div class="checker thin" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line light" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
